Subject: [PATCH] feat(receiver): LiquidationFlashReceiverV3 (Aave-only,
 7-field, fail-closed)

New flash-liquidation receiver for a future Base redeploy:
- 7-field params; routeType==0 only; receiveAToken must be false
- initiator==executor (never-zero) or self via liquidate(); OnlyPool; reentrancy guard
- delta-based balances; swap exactly seized collateral; fee via owner mapping
- minDebtOut floor = max(minCollateralOut, amount+premium); preexisting balance cannot cover
- sweep profit to profitRecipient; approvals reset; two-step owner; rescue; layoutId
- Foundry unit + Base fork E2E (local anvil); TS encoder in separate file (not wired live)
- Review doc with threat model, fee-tier findings, gas, cutover notes

No deploy/broadcast to mainnet or testnet.
